WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.901
- So that was a look at her show, "1883."

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.547
You can see it on Paramount+.

00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:06.950
So this show, "1883,"

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.160
it's your first major acting role?

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.300
'Cause I know that you
were in "Stepford Wives."

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.133
- Yes.
- And you've been

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:13.510
in some things, yeah.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:14.880
I loved that one.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.700
So, was it something that
you've always wanted to do

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.970
and you dipped your toes in a little bit,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.660
but then you had decided to just jump in?

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.480
- Yes, I started singing in church.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.190
- Yeah.
- But the first thing

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.240
that I did when I was in lower school,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.840
middle school, high school, were plays.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.980
I was on stage all the time.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.170
- Yeah.
- But then my career took off,

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.640
no time, had babies.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.760
- Yeah.
- Kept on having babies.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.530
Felt like I was having
babies all the time.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.210
- Yeah.
- And I had done

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.120
a couple of things.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.500
- Yeah.
- I did "Stepford Wives"

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.396
with an amazing cast.

00:00:42.396 --> 00:00:44.260
- Amazing, yeah?
- An amazing cast.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.940
It wasn't the best experience.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.695
So I said, "I will never, ever, ever,

00:00:48.695 --> 00:00:50.883
"ever do another, anything--"

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:52.660
- Was it not--
- "Like that, a movie,"

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.930
because it took so long.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:55.770
The waiting for me,
you have to understand.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:56.710
- Hurry up and wait.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:59.980
- I cannot, I have to be busy doing stuff.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.670
- Yeah.
- Anyway, and then I did

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.960
an independent thing called "Dixie Land,"

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.840
but I've read a lot of
scripts over the years

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.460
and this--
- Nothing ever really hit ya?

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.660
- Nothing hit me or the
timing wasn't right,

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:15.430
and then for the script to have been

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.770
so incredibly well-written,

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:21.230
I honestly had never
read anything like it.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:22.600
We're talking about "1883."

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.380
- Yeah.
- And so we just made

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:29.803
the decision to do it, to do it.

